# POLLY, TRANSPOSE moves everything, as an arranger keyboard's: the keys' chords and notes too. What the keys write or
# record plays back as it was heard, and moves with TRANSPOSE after. (MIDI in is not transposed.)
# Keys (octave 0): key K is MIDI 53 + K: C4 7, E4 11, G4 14. At 120 BPM a beat is 500 ms.
# Chords as expected: root * 100 + CH_* (maj 0).
wait 300
spin K2 15
expect tempo 120
# ---- FREE: C played at +2 sounds D (the big chord on HOME says so)
expect mode 0
spin K3 2
expect transpose 2
tap PLAY
wait 200
key 7 down
key 11 down
key 14 down
wait 100
key 7 up
key 11 up
key 14 up
wait 100
expect chord_root 2
expect home_chord_root 2
shot transpose_free.png
# TRANSPOSE moved: the keys' chord moves with it
spin K3 -2
wait 50
expect chord_root 0
spin K3 3
wait 50
expect chord_root 3
spin K3 -1
wait 50
expect transpose 2
expect chord_root 2
tap PLAY
wait 100
# ---- a chord written at +2 (step, into P12): C played, D heard; stored as C, played back as D
press HOME
tapkey w11
release HOME
expect mode 1
expect app_loop 12
tap REC
expect rec_chords 1
key 7 down
key 11 down
key 14 down
wait 50
key 7 up
key 11 up
key 14 up
wait 50
expect loop_ch12_0 0
expect chord_root 2
tap REC
expect rec_chords 0
tap PLAY
wait 300
expect loop_now 12
expect chord_root 2
# TRANSPOSE after: it moves
spin K3 1
wait 50
expect chord_root 3
spin K3 -1
wait 50
expect chord_root 2
tap PLAY
wait 100
# ---- a melody recorded at +2: C4 played over the song's C sounds D4; stored as D4 over D, played back as D4
# the song: two rows of P1 (C G Am F), its Intro off
tap HOME
expect page 1
tapkey w0
tapkey w0
expect rows 2
turn SELECT 1
expect page 2
turn K2 -1
expect song_intro 0
turn SELECT -1
tap HOME
tap HOME
tap PLAY
wait 300
tap PLAY
wait 100
expect mode 2
expect playing 0
# EDIT: ALGORITHM to LD1; REC arms it, PLAY starts the song from row 1 (after a bar of count-in)
tap EDIT
turn ALGO 4
expect lead_sel 1
tap REC
wait 50
expect recording 1
hitreset
tap PLAY
wait 2000
wait 960
key 7 down
wait 400
expect heard_ch7 62
key 7 up
wait 1600
expect lead_notes 1
expect lead1_note 62
expect lead1_root 2
tap REC
wait 50
expect recording 0
tap PLAY
wait 100
expect playing 0
# again from row 1: D4, as heard
hitreset
tap PLAY
wait 1500
expect heard_ch7 62
tap PLAY
wait 100
# TRANSPOSE +4 after: it moves with the song, E4
tap HOME
spin K3 2
expect transpose 4
hitreset
tap PLAY
wait 1500
expect heard_ch7 64
tap PLAY
wait 100
